WEBVTT

01:40.040 --> 01:42.000
IMPERIAL GUARDS OFFICE

01:47.720 --> 01:48.560
Commander.

01:53.080 --> 01:55.280
Xu Zhi, it was hard on you.

01:55.360 --> 01:56.400
Not at all.

01:56.480 --> 01:58.240
I only want to share your burden,
Commander.

01:58.320 --> 01:59.160
Great!

02:01.080 --> 02:02.320
Once we overcome this,

02:03.480 --> 02:05.520
I'll guarantee you
a luxurious life in the future.

02:05.600 --> 02:07.160
Thank you, Commander.

02:09.759 --> 02:12.000
Who allowed you to simply go out?

02:12.560 --> 02:14.880
Didn't I tell you to accompany
the Eldest Princess at home?

02:14.960 --> 02:16.640
What's up with her again?

02:16.720 --> 02:18.080
She's looking everywhere for you.

02:18.160 --> 02:20.920
There are maids and servants.
Why is she looking for me?

02:21.000 --> 02:23.080
You are the Prince Consort.
Who else could she go to?

02:23.160 --> 02:25.680
- I am--
- If something happens to Her Highness

02:25.760 --> 02:26.760
and her child,

02:26.840 --> 02:28.360
we'll both be executed.

02:28.440 --> 02:29.960
- Father.
- Li Jin.

02:33.600 --> 02:34.800
Put in some effort.

02:34.880 --> 02:36.040
I got it.

02:49.720 --> 02:50.760
I heard from Father

02:52.040 --> 02:53.160
that you were looking for me.

02:53.240 --> 02:54.720
My stomach has been hurting all day.

02:55.640 --> 02:57.160
Why didn't I see you?

02:57.240 --> 02:58.960
The maids and physician are here.

02:59.600 --> 03:00.800
Eldest Princess,

03:00.880 --> 03:02.440
you can give them orders at any time.

03:02.520 --> 03:04.040
Why should I order them?

03:05.400 --> 03:07.360
Aren't you my beloved Prince Consort?

03:08.920 --> 03:11.400
Isn't it your responsibility to serve me?

03:11.480 --> 03:12.600
I am clumsy.

03:14.480 --> 03:15.920
I might not take good care of you.

03:16.000 --> 03:18.000
- You should let--
- You can learn slowly.

03:20.720 --> 03:23.200
Meixiang, go.

03:23.280 --> 03:24.880
Bring a bucket for the Prince Consort,

03:25.640 --> 03:27.640
so he can get some water

03:29.160 --> 03:31.040
and wash my feet.

03:31.600 --> 03:32.440
Yes.

03:42.240 --> 03:43.120
What's the matter?

03:44.480 --> 03:45.640
Are you not willing to do it?

03:47.240 --> 03:49.440
Should I ask Li Zhongnan to come here

03:50.200 --> 03:53.000
and let him teach you how to wash my feet?

03:53.800 --> 03:54.920
That's not necessary.

03:56.320 --> 03:57.640
I can do it.

04:11.280 --> 04:12.680
This man

04:14.120 --> 04:18.120
walked all over me
when I showed him some respect.

04:21.360 --> 04:23.320
I need to educate him well.

04:25.760 --> 04:28.920
Otherwise, he won't learn the rules.

04:33.880 --> 04:35.520
DUKE SU'S MANSION

04:36.280 --> 04:37.320
His Majesty ordered

04:37.400 --> 04:39.160
Duke Su to be confined in his room.

04:39.240 --> 04:40.280
Guard him well.

04:40.360 --> 04:41.360
Yes.

04:50.040 --> 04:50.880
Xue Zhao.

04:55.960 --> 04:57.440
What's happening here?

04:58.080 --> 04:58.920
Xue Li,

04:59.000 --> 04:59.960
you're not aware.

05:00.560 --> 05:03.320
Soldiers from the Imperial Guards Office
surrounded Duke's Mansion

05:03.400 --> 05:05.520
and confronted my brother-in-law's guards.

05:05.600 --> 05:08.600
If General Xiao hadn't mediated,
something terrible might have happened.

05:08.680 --> 05:11.880
The Duke's Mansion
is being controlled now?

05:11.960 --> 05:14.200
Xue Li, you didn't see my brother-in-law?

05:16.840 --> 05:19.000
He was confined
in the bedroom at the back.

05:19.080 --> 05:21.880
Apparently, His Majesty
ordered him not to come out.

05:27.280 --> 05:29.160
Xue Li, I haven't eaten them.

05:29.720 --> 05:31.920
Xue Li!

05:36.680 --> 05:39.240
Sirs, I'm delivering food to Duke Su.

05:44.360 --> 05:45.200
Thank you.

05:53.040 --> 05:54.160
Duke Su,

05:54.240 --> 05:57.560
are you in confinement?

05:57.640 --> 05:58.560
Isn't it obvious?

06:02.360 --> 06:03.200
Tell me.

06:04.320 --> 06:05.240
What about?

06:05.320 --> 06:07.360
You're not the reckless type.

06:07.440 --> 06:10.440
The act must be convincing.

06:11.000 --> 06:12.360
Are you turning against His Majesty?

06:12.440 --> 06:13.320
You are smart.

06:13.400 --> 06:14.840
How long will you be confined?

06:15.520 --> 06:16.360
Two days.

06:16.960 --> 06:18.040
So short?

06:18.120 --> 06:19.440
We can't go too far.

06:19.520 --> 06:21.160
Otherwise, people will be suspicious.

06:21.920 --> 06:25.400
Doing it just right will hit the mark.

06:25.480 --> 06:27.920
Is it an act
between you and General Xiao too?

06:28.000 --> 06:29.200
He's not worthy to act with me.

06:29.840 --> 06:31.520
- That day, why--
- I don't want to talk about him.

06:34.040 --> 06:35.720
In that case, I'll be leaving.

06:37.720 --> 06:38.840
Isn't this for me?

06:40.720 --> 06:41.960
It's for my brother.

06:42.040 --> 06:43.320
I'll deliver it to him later.

06:48.080 --> 06:50.760
I thought you came to visit
because you were worried about me.

06:51.600 --> 06:54.400
I didn't expect to misunderstand again.

06:55.600 --> 06:56.800
You didn't misunderstand.

06:57.360 --> 07:00.720
I did come to visit
because I was worried about you.

07:03.840 --> 07:06.280
Xue Fangfei, wait. Xue Fangfei!

07:17.080 --> 07:18.440
Why are both of you here?

07:21.720 --> 07:22.800
You can't go in too?

07:23.280 --> 07:25.480
His Majesty's imperial guards
are guarding his lordship's room.

07:26.040 --> 07:27.360
Secret guards like us can't enter too.

07:27.920 --> 07:29.080
We can only guard him here.

07:29.160 --> 07:30.440
I was looking for you two.

07:31.200 --> 07:33.480
I heard Xiao Heng and General Xiao

07:34.040 --> 07:35.760
had a fight in front of people that day.

07:35.840 --> 07:38.840
They are grandparent and grandson.

07:38.920 --> 07:40.400
Why do they seem like enemies?

07:41.160 --> 07:42.280
Shut your mouth.

07:44.240 --> 07:46.120
Ms. Jiang Li is not an outsider.

07:46.200 --> 07:47.040
Besides,

07:47.120 --> 07:48.520
it has been so many years,

07:48.600 --> 07:50.040
and they still can't make up.

07:50.600 --> 07:52.680
Perhaps she has a way.

07:57.280 --> 07:58.960
His Lordship can't move on

07:59.040 --> 08:01.800
from General Xiao Minghan's death.

08:02.360 --> 08:04.840
After General Xiao Minghan
died on the battlefield back then,

08:05.360 --> 08:08.080
Vice General Peng
went to see General Xiao.

08:08.640 --> 08:11.040
Did you see it yourself?

08:12.160 --> 08:13.040
I swear

08:13.520 --> 08:14.880
that I'm telling the truth.

08:14.960 --> 08:17.040
They abandoned General Xiao.

08:18.160 --> 08:19.760
They could have saved General Xiao,

08:20.760 --> 08:23.720
but not only
did they not send reinforcements,

08:24.200 --> 08:25.040
they also

08:25.120 --> 08:28.400
blocked General Xiao's only escape route.

08:30.520 --> 08:32.400
Later on, things went in a direction

08:32.480 --> 08:34.400
that his lordship
didn't want to see the most.

08:40.159 --> 08:41.159
General Xiao,

08:42.440 --> 08:44.880
General Xiao Minghan
and the Longwu Army shouldn't die in vain.

08:44.960 --> 08:47.400
I beg you to come out of retirement

08:48.120 --> 08:49.320
and lead the Longwu Army again.

08:49.920 --> 08:52.960
Prince Cheng shed crocodile tears
for General Xiao to go out of retirement.

08:53.440 --> 08:54.640
But if he accepted his request,

08:55.160 --> 08:56.680
it would mean he agreed

08:56.760 --> 08:58.680
that General Xiao Minghan
died on the battlefield.

08:59.600 --> 09:02.560
Vice General Peng thought General Xiao

09:02.640 --> 09:04.240
would expose Lord Cheng's true colors.

09:05.040 --> 09:06.120
I will

09:07.800 --> 09:08.880
come out of retirement

09:09.440 --> 09:11.200
and lead the Longwu Army again.

09:12.760 --> 09:15.000
The disappointed
Vice General Peng insisted

09:15.080 --> 09:16.760
on investigating
General Xiao Minghan's death.

09:18.040 --> 09:20.120
But how can anything change

09:21.400 --> 09:22.920
if his own father accepted it?

09:24.560 --> 09:27.160
Vice General Peng was falsely accused
of spreading rumors instead.

09:27.240 --> 09:30.280
He was also found
to have embezzled military funds

09:30.760 --> 09:31.840
and was executed.

09:33.360 --> 09:34.920
The only person who knew the truth

09:35.520 --> 09:36.400
died just like that.

09:38.160 --> 09:39.720
Why won't you let people investigate?

09:39.800 --> 09:42.720
You just let my father
die on the battlefield!

09:42.800 --> 09:44.920
You're a big jerk
who only cares about fame and fortune!

09:45.400 --> 09:46.520
As for General Xiao,

09:47.240 --> 09:48.320
since the Longwu Army

09:48.400 --> 09:50.240
was formed by the elites
of the Imperial Guards,

09:50.960 --> 09:54.440
heturned from a retired old man

09:54.520 --> 09:56.360
into someone who controlled
the imperial army.

09:57.040 --> 09:58.880
He basked in glory instantly.

10:00.040 --> 10:01.080
Since then,

10:01.160 --> 10:03.320
His lordship had a falling out
with General Xiao.

10:03.880 --> 10:05.840
His Lordship wanted
to continue investigating,

10:05.920 --> 10:07.240
like what the Vice General did,

10:07.320 --> 10:08.520
to seek justice for his father,

10:09.000 --> 10:10.480
but General Xiao stopped him

10:10.560 --> 10:13.040
and confined him
in the Duke's Mansion for five years.

10:13.120 --> 10:15.680
During those five years,

10:16.160 --> 10:18.440
he had nothing to do apart from gardening

10:18.520 --> 10:19.880
and listening to songs.

10:19.960 --> 10:22.400
His personality changed drastically too.

10:22.480 --> 10:23.880
I see.

10:25.640 --> 10:27.240
I want to meet General Xiao.

10:43.160 --> 10:46.160
Are you here because of Xiao Heng?

10:56.040 --> 10:56.960
General Xiao.

10:57.800 --> 10:59.120
Is that Duke Su?

11:02.240 --> 11:03.520
That is

11:03.600 --> 11:04.920
General Xiao Minghan.

11:05.520 --> 11:06.600
Then, that person…

11:06.680 --> 11:10.000
This person is Xiao Heng's mother,

11:10.920 --> 11:12.040
Yu Hongye.

11:12.640 --> 11:14.960
She was a musician at the Music Office,

11:15.040 --> 11:17.280
who accompanied Minghan in the south.

11:17.760 --> 11:21.440
She was extremely good at singing.

11:22.280 --> 11:24.680
The whole family
was keeping the south safe.

11:25.760 --> 11:27.240
I hardly got to see them,

11:28.040 --> 11:29.920
so I hired a painter

11:30.520 --> 11:31.520
to draw this painting

11:32.000 --> 11:33.280
as a memorabilia.

11:33.800 --> 11:35.160
Then these are…

11:37.560 --> 11:39.640
This is the helmet my son used.

11:46.760 --> 11:47.760
And that one.

11:48.280 --> 11:51.040
It's the fan his wife when singing.

11:53.280 --> 11:54.280
This one too.

11:55.280 --> 11:59.320
This was Xiao Heng's favorite toy.

11:59.400 --> 12:01.240
He wouldn't let it go
once he gets a hold of it.

12:04.000 --> 12:05.040
And these wines

12:06.040 --> 12:08.280
were Xiao Heng's father's favorites.

12:08.360 --> 12:10.680
I would send them to the camp
as soon as they were brewed.

12:11.280 --> 12:12.160
But now…

12:17.760 --> 12:20.160
General Xiao, do you look
at these things every day?

12:21.280 --> 12:24.960
I look at these things to remember them.

12:30.480 --> 12:33.360
I can see how much

12:34.000 --> 12:36.200
you love Duke Su.

12:36.280 --> 12:38.560
I heard about what happened in the past.

12:39.240 --> 12:41.080
I wonder if I can hear

12:41.160 --> 12:42.520
your version of the story.

12:43.240 --> 12:45.520
With what identity are you asking this?

12:48.040 --> 12:49.240
Xiao Heng's

12:50.320 --> 12:51.360
loved one.

12:54.160 --> 12:55.800
I also love him.

13:00.040 --> 13:03.760
You are much more straightforward
than Tortoise Jiang.

13:03.840 --> 13:06.560
May I know what happened back then?

13:09.120 --> 13:12.640
I think we should move on from the past.

13:13.400 --> 13:15.520
However, you can ask someone about it.

13:16.360 --> 13:17.600
But do keep it a secret.

13:17.680 --> 13:19.680
Don't tell Xiao Heng.

13:20.400 --> 13:21.720
It'll be bad if he finds out.

13:21.800 --> 13:22.720
General Xiao,

13:24.440 --> 13:26.240
I think Duke Su

13:26.800 --> 13:29.240
should be the one to judge
whether it's good or bad.

13:34.280 --> 13:36.080
I'm not supposed to eat cold food lately.

13:39.640 --> 13:40.520
It's too greasy.

13:50.840 --> 13:52.240
Just the look of it disgusts me.

14:01.880 --> 14:03.640
You know I don't eat shrimp, don't you?

14:04.120 --> 14:05.320
Why did you give this to me?

14:13.560 --> 14:14.440
Here.

14:15.280 --> 14:16.160
Eat it.

14:26.960 --> 14:28.440
My hand is numb.

14:36.320 --> 14:38.880
I got the shrimp for you.

14:38.960 --> 14:40.560
Are you just going to let it go to waste?

14:45.560 --> 14:46.840
Eat it.

14:47.560 --> 14:48.400
What?

14:49.000 --> 14:49.840
Eat it.

14:52.160 --> 14:53.320
Eldest Princess.

14:53.880 --> 14:55.480
You are going overboard.

14:55.560 --> 14:56.760
How so?

14:57.960 --> 14:58.800
Can't you

14:59.880 --> 15:02.880
understand that a pregnant woman

15:03.920 --> 15:05.320
has no strength in her hands?

15:06.960 --> 15:08.480
It's very simple.

15:09.880 --> 15:12.160
If you don't want
to eat the shrimp on the floor,

15:13.280 --> 15:14.360
just kneel and apologize.

15:15.320 --> 15:17.120
Say you will listen to everything I say

15:17.200 --> 15:19.800
and I won't care about you wasting food.

15:39.200 --> 15:40.120
Eldest Princess,

15:43.320 --> 15:45.240
I respect your identity.

15:51.160 --> 15:52.000
But remember,

15:52.080 --> 15:55.720
that doesn't mean I can endure everything.

15:56.840 --> 15:58.520
I can kneel and apologize to you,

16:00.440 --> 16:03.000
but I'm not Shen Yurong,
who will wag my tail and beg!

16:05.280 --> 16:06.480
How impetuous!

16:06.560 --> 16:08.680
Shen Yurong is your dog,

16:09.160 --> 16:10.280
but I'm not.

16:10.760 --> 16:12.360
My father is the Imperial Secretariat

16:12.440 --> 16:13.640
and Chancellor!

16:13.720 --> 16:15.320
Please know your limits!

16:16.800 --> 16:18.520
Who do you think you are?

16:19.000 --> 16:20.000
Are you worthy?

16:20.080 --> 16:21.440
Can you speak badly about Yurong?

16:21.520 --> 16:23.800
Let me tell you.
You are nothing compared to him!

16:23.880 --> 16:24.920
Do you know that?

16:29.440 --> 16:30.520
In that case,

16:31.760 --> 16:32.640
I, Li Jin,

16:34.080 --> 16:36.240
won't be an eyesore to you anymore.

16:37.960 --> 16:40.200
You can go and find Yurong.

17:22.359 --> 17:23.200
Sirs,

17:23.680 --> 17:25.400
I'm here to deliver food for Duke Su.

17:28.200 --> 17:30.040
This is Duke Su's distant relative.

17:30.560 --> 17:32.080
It has been a long time since they met.

17:32.160 --> 17:33.480
Please let them meet each other.

17:34.760 --> 17:36.240
We won't cause trouble for you two.

17:36.880 --> 17:38.040
Make it quick.

17:38.120 --> 17:39.840
We will chase you out
if you take too long.

17:39.920 --> 17:40.920
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

17:56.000 --> 17:57.880
You've all grown up,

17:58.520 --> 17:59.720
Young Master.

18:00.360 --> 18:01.200
Ms. Wang.

18:04.000 --> 18:04.880
Why are you here?

18:07.760 --> 18:09.680
After so many years, I can't believe

18:09.760 --> 18:10.920
you still remember me.

18:11.520 --> 18:12.440
Of course I do.

18:13.040 --> 18:14.240
After my parents passed away,

18:14.320 --> 18:15.960
you were the one who took care of me.

18:16.800 --> 18:18.840
However, I don't know
why you left suddenly.

18:19.480 --> 18:20.320
I…

18:22.040 --> 18:22.960
Young Master.

18:23.040 --> 18:24.680
What are you doing? Stand up.

18:27.280 --> 18:28.320
Young Master,

18:28.400 --> 18:30.480
do you remember being seriously ill

18:30.560 --> 18:32.000
when you were little?

18:32.080 --> 18:33.880
You had a high fever,
vomited, and had diarrhea.

18:34.720 --> 18:35.600
I do.

18:36.360 --> 18:38.160
That old man was busy with work

18:38.240 --> 18:39.480
and locked me up in the mansion.

18:39.560 --> 18:40.600
Only you took care of me.

18:41.160 --> 18:42.040
Actually,

18:45.080 --> 18:47.080
I poisoned you back then.

18:49.840 --> 18:50.760
What?

18:53.480 --> 18:55.480
Thankfully, it was discovered early.

18:56.080 --> 18:58.040
The physician examined him
and gave him medicine.

18:58.120 --> 19:00.360
Young Master is asleep now.

19:01.280 --> 19:04.040
This child is very naughty

19:04.120 --> 19:05.880
and he caused you a lot of trouble.

19:06.440 --> 19:07.280
Not at all.

19:07.360 --> 19:09.240
Young Master has always been good.

19:11.320 --> 19:12.440
Why did you harm him?

19:14.360 --> 19:16.880
I found half a pack of this poison
in your room.

19:17.440 --> 19:19.000
You weren't trying to kill him.

19:19.080 --> 19:19.960
Tell me.

19:21.760 --> 19:22.600
I can help you.

19:24.840 --> 19:25.960
General Xiao,

19:26.040 --> 19:27.840
I'm sorry for what I did to Young Master,

19:27.920 --> 19:29.680
but I had no choice.

19:29.760 --> 19:31.760
My child is in their hands.

19:31.840 --> 19:34.240
General Xiao, I…

19:36.280 --> 19:38.080
General Xiao knew I was forced to do it.

19:38.720 --> 19:40.120
Not only didn't he blame me,

19:40.200 --> 19:41.960
he even got me escorted out of the capital

19:42.520 --> 19:43.880
and gave me some money.

19:44.880 --> 19:46.440
He hopes that I can testify

19:46.520 --> 19:48.200
when he gets a chance to overturn the case

19:48.280 --> 19:49.360
of your father.

19:50.080 --> 19:53.480
However, he never came to find me

19:53.560 --> 19:56.320
until yesterday when this lady came to me.

19:56.400 --> 19:59.600
Did he really say
he would help overturn Father's case?

20:00.120 --> 20:00.960
Yes.

20:01.040 --> 20:03.640
General Xiao has been
helping me all these years.

20:03.720 --> 20:06.160
He also told me a lot of stories
between him and your father.

20:06.240 --> 20:09.240
General Xiao really misses
your father a lot.

20:09.800 --> 20:11.200
I think Prince Cheng

20:11.280 --> 20:13.120
used you being poisoned

20:13.200 --> 20:14.600
to blackmail General Xiao.

20:15.320 --> 20:17.280
He truly wanted to protect you back then.

20:18.240 --> 20:19.080
How do you know

20:20.520 --> 20:22.160
it wasn't just an act?

20:22.760 --> 20:24.280
You can see for yourself

20:24.360 --> 20:26.120
to know whether it is an act or not.

20:26.200 --> 20:27.440
All these years,

20:27.520 --> 20:29.200
I'm sure you haven't been to his mansion.

20:30.440 --> 20:32.240
When your confinement is over tomorrow,

20:32.320 --> 20:33.600
you should go with me.

20:35.800 --> 20:37.000
No matter what,

20:38.280 --> 20:41.080
just go for my sake.

20:42.040 --> 20:42.880
All right?

20:55.360 --> 20:56.480
Imperial Physician Chu.

20:57.080 --> 20:58.080
Is the child fine?

20:58.840 --> 21:00.440
Calm down, Eldest Princess.

21:00.520 --> 21:02.160
I'll tell you after I finish checking.

21:04.520 --> 21:05.800
Nothing must happen.

21:08.880 --> 21:11.880
LI RESIDENCE

21:20.760 --> 21:21.600
Father.

21:22.200 --> 21:23.600
What's going on?

21:24.280 --> 21:25.520
The child…

21:31.160 --> 21:32.240
The child can't be saved.

21:32.880 --> 21:33.800
This is serious.

21:33.880 --> 21:35.040
To be safe,

21:35.120 --> 21:37.520
please ask other imperial physicians
to do another diagnosis.

21:38.160 --> 21:40.320
You're the best physician
at the Imperial Academy of Medicine.

21:41.040 --> 21:42.840
Who else can I go to?

21:43.800 --> 21:45.200
Think of another way.

21:45.280 --> 21:46.840
I've prescribed calming medicine.

21:47.560 --> 21:50.680
Please make sure
the Eldest Princess stay calm.

22:21.360 --> 22:23.520
Take your time to chat.

22:28.480 --> 22:29.920
Xiao Heng is here!

22:32.240 --> 22:33.080
Shut up.

23:03.960 --> 23:04.800
This is…

23:05.280 --> 23:10.000
That is a painting drawn
by a painter I hired back then.

23:12.640 --> 23:15.560
I didn't expect you'd still keep it.

23:15.640 --> 23:16.880
For me,

23:17.840 --> 23:20.760
all of you are the people I treasure most.

23:20.840 --> 23:22.080
The people you treasure most?

23:26.360 --> 23:29.760
So when Mr. Peng told you
the truth about my father's death,

23:29.840 --> 23:31.680
how did you treat
the people you treasure most?

23:32.520 --> 23:35.560
Didn't you collude with Prince Cheng
to regain control over the imperial army?

23:36.360 --> 23:37.760
Nonsense.

23:48.600 --> 23:49.600
Why would I collude

23:50.080 --> 23:53.920
with a murderer who killed my son?

23:56.480 --> 23:58.760
You only know Prince Cheng
got your father killed,

23:58.840 --> 23:59.960
but you don't know

24:00.520 --> 24:02.160
how he caused his death.

24:03.400 --> 24:05.600
WANG CITY, BORDER OF GREAT YAN

24:05.680 --> 24:06.520
Why?

24:07.040 --> 24:07.960
Why are we retreating?

24:08.680 --> 24:10.800
We were not that desperate.

24:10.880 --> 24:12.240
If we hold on for another few days,

24:12.920 --> 24:16.000
we'd be able to protect Wang City
when reinforcements arrived.

24:16.760 --> 24:17.960
Falling rocks blocked the path.

24:18.760 --> 24:20.080
Reinforcements couldn't come.

24:20.640 --> 24:22.280
We don't have enough rations too.

24:22.880 --> 24:25.400
If this city can't give provisions,
there's no need to protect it.

24:26.360 --> 24:29.000
What we should do now
is to retreat back to Mao City

24:29.080 --> 24:30.520
and meet with reinforcements

24:30.600 --> 24:31.880
before coming back

24:32.440 --> 24:33.320
to reclaim Wang City.

24:34.320 --> 24:35.280
Are you afraid to die?

24:37.960 --> 24:39.280
I'm not afraid of death.

24:39.360 --> 24:41.160
I don't want to make
unnecessary sacrifices.

24:41.240 --> 24:42.600
What about the people of Wang City?

24:43.360 --> 24:45.040
Are their lives not important?

24:45.600 --> 24:46.640
Once we retreat,

24:47.120 --> 24:48.920
the enemy will enter an empty city.

24:49.000 --> 24:51.560
Once they break in,
they will kill and rob everyone.

24:52.360 --> 24:54.800
All the people of the city
will be massacred

24:54.880 --> 24:55.840
in a bloodbath.

24:56.800 --> 24:57.880
As generals and soldiers,

25:00.080 --> 25:02.120
shouldn't we protect the peace here?

25:02.200 --> 25:03.720
We can die in battle,

25:05.000 --> 25:06.360
but we cannot abandon a city.

25:06.440 --> 25:07.840
Master, that's enough.

25:09.560 --> 25:10.760
I am the commander.

25:12.080 --> 25:13.240
I've made my decision.

25:14.560 --> 25:15.560
Today,

25:16.320 --> 25:18.920
the whole army
must retreat from Wang City.

25:19.000 --> 25:22.160
The Longwu Army will not leave.

25:22.680 --> 25:24.280
A military order is absolute.

25:25.840 --> 25:29.080
Master, do you want them
to be punished by military law?

25:40.480 --> 25:41.320
WANG CITY

25:41.400 --> 25:43.280
General, according to your orders,

25:43.360 --> 25:45.880
the Longwu Army and Prince Cheng
have retreated to Mao City.

25:45.960 --> 25:46.800
Right now,

25:47.320 --> 25:49.600
we only have fewer than 200 soldiers left.

25:49.680 --> 25:51.120
Our scouts reported

25:52.040 --> 25:54.600
that the enemy is less than 15 km away.

25:55.160 --> 25:57.000
- General.
- Leave 100 soldiers

25:58.640 --> 26:00.000
to protect and evacuate the people.

26:00.080 --> 26:01.480
It's too late, General.

26:01.560 --> 26:04.480
There's a valley up ahead.

26:05.760 --> 26:08.320
It's a place where one man
can hold out against 10,000.

26:08.400 --> 26:11.160
The remaining 100 soldiers will follow me

26:11.840 --> 26:13.320
and guard that path

26:14.560 --> 26:16.000
until dusk tomorrow.

26:17.600 --> 26:18.520
Then the people

26:19.840 --> 26:21.360
will be able to evacuate safely.

26:21.440 --> 26:22.320
What about you?

26:23.320 --> 26:25.080
There won't be reinforcements to save you.

26:25.560 --> 26:26.400
It's all right.

26:29.480 --> 26:30.320
WANG CITY

26:30.400 --> 26:31.360
My fate is sealed.

27:13.120 --> 27:15.400
General!

27:16.760 --> 27:18.880
All the people of Wang City
have been evacuated.

27:18.960 --> 27:20.200
We should retreat as well.

27:26.200 --> 27:27.320
General,

27:27.400 --> 27:28.760
more enemies are coming.

27:30.280 --> 27:31.120
General,

27:31.200 --> 27:33.520
we can retreat to Wang City
if we take the north river valley.

27:34.080 --> 27:37.200
The gates of Wang City are closed.

27:37.280 --> 27:38.720
We can't go back anymore.

27:38.800 --> 27:39.640
What?

27:40.120 --> 27:41.240
Why did they close the gates?

27:41.320 --> 27:42.840
It was Prince Cheng's decision.

27:43.400 --> 27:45.040
Prince Cheng wants us to die!

27:49.400 --> 27:50.320
Back then,

27:52.480 --> 27:53.880
I shouldn't have spared him.

27:54.360 --> 27:55.240
General.

28:01.320 --> 28:02.160
Comrades,

28:02.720 --> 28:05.840
this is a battle to the death!

28:06.520 --> 28:07.600
Since it has come to this,

28:09.520 --> 28:11.960
there's no need
to have any hope to stay alive.

28:12.040 --> 28:13.080
Peng Guang!

28:13.560 --> 28:14.400
Yes!

28:16.240 --> 28:18.840
I want you to remember all the names

28:18.920 --> 28:21.120
of the 100 soldiers of the Longwu Army.

28:21.680 --> 28:23.360
Go back and tell General Xiao

28:23.440 --> 28:25.480
that we have not
let the people of Wang City,

28:26.480 --> 28:27.520
His Majesty,

28:27.600 --> 28:29.160
and Great Yan down!

28:30.280 --> 28:32.160
No. General, I won't leave!

28:32.240 --> 28:34.000
I want to fight with you!

28:36.000 --> 28:37.880
You are the only one who can make it back.

28:38.760 --> 28:39.600
Leave now!

28:40.080 --> 28:41.320
I'm not leaving, General!

28:42.080 --> 28:42.920
General!

28:43.000 --> 28:45.240
- Vice General Peng, you should go!
- I'm not leaving!

28:45.320 --> 28:46.280
Vice General Peng!

28:46.360 --> 28:47.200
General!

28:47.280 --> 28:48.440
Vice General Peng!

28:48.520 --> 28:49.760
General!

29:02.240 --> 29:04.200
Longwu Army! Obey my command!

29:04.280 --> 29:05.200
- Yes!
- Yes!

29:05.760 --> 29:07.840
Don't expect to stay alive in this battle!

29:13.800 --> 29:18.480
- Charge!
- Charge!

29:18.560 --> 29:19.400
Fire!

29:32.400 --> 29:33.920
To not let others know

29:34.680 --> 29:37.240
he abandoned the people of Wang City,

29:38.520 --> 29:40.720
he blocked Father's escape

29:41.600 --> 29:43.000
and forced him to die.

29:44.560 --> 29:46.000
Father did not die in battle.

29:47.080 --> 29:50.120
He was abandoned and killed.

29:53.000 --> 29:54.800
You knew that.

29:54.880 --> 29:56.160
Why didn't you investigate?

29:56.720 --> 29:59.240
Prince Cheng turned you

29:59.320 --> 30:01.000
into a weakness to control me.

30:02.080 --> 30:04.200
If I was even slightly careless,

30:04.280 --> 30:05.960
someone like Ms. Wang

30:06.040 --> 30:07.560
would kill you.

30:08.760 --> 30:10.440
They need me to admit

30:10.520 --> 30:13.520
that Minghan died in battle

30:13.600 --> 30:16.560
to cover their lies.

30:16.640 --> 30:19.520
That's why they didn't kill off

30:20.040 --> 30:21.280
the Xiao family.

30:22.360 --> 30:23.760
You were so little back then

30:23.840 --> 30:25.560
and only saw me regain control
over the imperial army.

30:25.640 --> 30:27.680
You knew nothing
about what went on afterward.

30:27.760 --> 30:28.760
Now that you've grown up,

30:29.840 --> 30:31.440
you are still hung up on this.

30:35.720 --> 30:38.200
Why won't you let me investigate
the Imperial Guards Office then?

30:39.280 --> 30:41.840
You want to protect
the subordinate you promoted, right?

30:41.920 --> 30:44.160
Don't you know
that he's colluding with Prince Cheng?

30:44.240 --> 30:45.160
How can I not know?

30:46.000 --> 30:48.640
Why did I tell you to release Xu Zhi?

30:49.120 --> 30:50.920
He told me a year ago

30:51.480 --> 30:54.760
that Zhang Wei was communicating
with people in the north.

30:55.560 --> 30:57.680
I told him not to make it public

30:57.760 --> 30:59.000
and observe secretly first.

30:59.560 --> 31:00.920
He is the spy

31:01.000 --> 31:03.080
that I planted
in the Imperial Guards Office.

31:03.160 --> 31:04.360
I must protect him.

31:07.040 --> 31:08.560
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

31:08.640 --> 31:10.040
Did you give me a chance?

31:15.000 --> 31:16.480
Since Mr. Peng left,

31:16.560 --> 31:18.720
I confined you in the mansion.

31:19.880 --> 31:22.280
You wouldn't listen to anything I say.

31:22.840 --> 31:25.600
I didn't want you to see the treachery
in people's hearts

31:25.680 --> 31:28.040
at such a young age.

31:29.000 --> 31:30.760
I wanted to tell you the reason

31:30.840 --> 31:32.320
when you grew older.

31:34.840 --> 31:36.040
Unexpectedly,

31:36.560 --> 31:40.120
the grudge is so difficult to resolve.

31:41.360 --> 31:42.920
It's tough.

31:43.000 --> 31:44.280
It's good that you know.

31:45.840 --> 31:47.360
I told you so much

31:47.880 --> 31:50.520
not because I hope
you'll understand and forgive me.

31:50.600 --> 31:51.760
I just want to tell you

31:52.840 --> 31:53.840
that Xu Zhi

31:54.480 --> 31:58.080
is not working for Prince Cheng.

31:58.160 --> 31:59.320
Understand?

32:01.080 --> 32:02.640
I don't understand you.

32:02.720 --> 32:05.280
You can explain all this
in a few sentences,

32:05.360 --> 32:07.360
but you dragged it on for so many years.

32:09.000 --> 32:13.040
Do you still remember
the names of the 100 soldiers?

32:13.120 --> 32:14.760
I remember every one of them.

32:15.760 --> 32:16.960
I remember them clearly.

32:17.040 --> 32:18.320
Good.

32:20.400 --> 32:21.280
What do you want?

32:21.840 --> 32:23.440
Seek justice for them.

32:24.160 --> 32:25.640
It's not that easy.

32:26.360 --> 32:28.280
If Jiang Li can redress
Xue Huaiyuan's case,

32:30.560 --> 32:32.760
why can't I give my father justice?

32:33.800 --> 32:37.680
Am I worse than a woman?

32:44.280 --> 32:45.480
My grandson

32:46.600 --> 32:47.640
has good taste.

32:49.440 --> 32:50.640
The girl is not bad.

32:52.000 --> 32:53.080
She is worthy of you.

32:59.080 --> 33:00.120
You…

33:04.120 --> 33:05.480
Come home with me.

33:06.240 --> 33:08.120
Prince Cheng will soon
arrive in the capital.

33:08.200 --> 33:11.040
Stay in the Duke's Mansion with me
during this period of time.

33:12.000 --> 33:12.840
Don't misunderstand.

33:13.320 --> 33:15.400
I just don't want
to collect your dead body.

33:28.080 --> 33:30.080
This grandson of mine has good taste.

33:30.160 --> 33:31.880
Go home.

33:33.560 --> 33:34.560
What are you saying?

33:34.640 --> 33:35.480
Say it again.

33:37.280 --> 33:38.200
Go home.

33:38.280 --> 33:39.360
Yes.

33:40.560 --> 33:41.640
Go home.

33:42.840 --> 33:43.720
Go home.

33:45.760 --> 33:47.240
Go home.

33:47.320 --> 33:52.080
SHEN RESIDENCE

33:57.880 --> 33:58.720
Mr. Shen,

33:59.320 --> 34:01.640
I found the herb
you asked me to find previously.

34:03.240 --> 34:04.680
Is it the kind I want?

34:05.320 --> 34:06.200
Yes.

34:06.280 --> 34:08.239
This herb only exists in Great Zhao.

34:08.320 --> 34:09.560
In the past,

34:09.639 --> 34:11.679
it was commonly used to treat colds.

34:11.760 --> 34:13.880
However, overdosing on this

34:14.480 --> 34:17.320
makes it accumulate in the stomach.

34:17.400 --> 34:18.239
Accumulate?

34:19.520 --> 34:20.840
Will it cause a bloated stomach

34:21.520 --> 34:22.719
with nausea and vomiting?

34:22.800 --> 34:23.920
That's right.

34:24.000 --> 34:26.440
Someone who takes this

34:26.520 --> 34:28.639
will have a similar pulse to pregnancy.

34:28.719 --> 34:31.719
In the end, there will even be
a sign of miscarriage.

34:32.760 --> 34:35.920
I've asked many folk healers in the city.

34:36.000 --> 34:37.440
In the past, this herb

34:37.520 --> 34:39.760
caused many misunderstandings
in the villages.

34:40.320 --> 34:43.040
Since its harm outweighs its benefits,

34:43.600 --> 34:47.120
fewer people are using it

34:47.199 --> 34:50.639
to the point
where not many people know about it.

34:50.719 --> 34:51.760
I asked someone

34:52.320 --> 34:54.719
to purchase this herb from Great Zhao,

34:55.320 --> 34:57.520
so it took some time.

34:58.360 --> 34:59.920
How long does the effect last?

35:00.480 --> 35:01.680
About a month.

35:09.520 --> 35:11.360
I kept telling you

35:11.960 --> 35:13.920
to be nicer to the Eldest Princess

35:14.600 --> 35:16.240
and give yourself a way out.

35:17.520 --> 35:19.840
Why wouldn't you listen to me?

35:21.360 --> 35:22.320
Father,

35:22.400 --> 35:23.520
I've already

35:24.360 --> 35:26.000
followed all of her orders.

35:28.720 --> 35:29.880
You didn't see it that day.

35:29.960 --> 35:31.160
She purposely--

35:33.160 --> 35:34.120
Endure it.

35:35.440 --> 35:38.120
Didn't I tell you to endure it?

35:38.200 --> 35:39.720
How else should I endure it?

35:41.480 --> 35:44.560
I've already endured her arrogance
in front of me.

35:44.640 --> 35:45.560
Should I

35:46.200 --> 35:47.680
become her dog instead?

35:47.760 --> 35:49.240
Woof!

35:49.880 --> 35:51.440
Will you only be satisfied when I grovel

35:51.520 --> 35:52.920
at her feet to please her?

35:54.040 --> 35:56.200
The Li family is prestigious in the city.

35:56.800 --> 35:58.320
I don't mind being humiliated,

35:59.320 --> 36:01.560
but can you be humiliated too, Father?

36:01.640 --> 36:03.600
You bastard!

36:12.240 --> 36:13.520
What should we do now?

36:15.080 --> 36:15.920
What should we do?

36:23.000 --> 36:27.040
The child is gone.

36:27.120 --> 36:29.680
The child is lost

36:29.760 --> 36:31.040
after you argued with her.

36:31.720 --> 36:33.480
No one can save us.

36:36.320 --> 36:37.520
Both of us have to die.

36:43.320 --> 36:44.320
Father.

36:45.920 --> 36:46.880
In that case,

36:49.040 --> 36:51.120
I'll go and apologize
to the Eldest Princess.

36:51.880 --> 36:53.040
Yes.

36:53.600 --> 36:55.080
At most, I'll ask her to execute me.

36:55.160 --> 36:56.240
Don't worry, Father.

36:56.320 --> 36:57.520
I won't drag you down.

36:58.080 --> 36:58.920
What did you say?

36:59.600 --> 37:00.520
Li Jin!

37:07.000 --> 37:08.000
Not bad.

37:09.840 --> 37:11.400
You dare to come alone.

37:12.600 --> 37:13.920
One life for another then.

37:14.400 --> 37:17.240
You and your father
cost me my child's life.

37:18.280 --> 37:19.560
You can die with her.

37:20.200 --> 37:21.280
Eldest Princess!

37:23.160 --> 37:24.320
Hold it.

37:25.520 --> 37:26.800
Eldest Princess,

37:27.400 --> 37:29.840
none of us want this to happen, right?

37:29.920 --> 37:31.120
This is a misunderstanding.

37:31.200 --> 37:32.040
A misunderstanding?

37:33.200 --> 37:35.600
Are you using this word
to pay for my child's life?

37:35.680 --> 37:38.520
If this rascal offended you,

37:38.600 --> 37:40.360
I will punish him.

37:40.440 --> 37:41.960
I will whip him 20 times.

37:42.720 --> 37:43.720
What do you think?

37:46.320 --> 37:47.200
Li Zhongnan,

37:48.200 --> 37:50.120
what if I insist on taking his life today?

37:51.400 --> 37:52.560
What can you do?

37:55.120 --> 37:55.960
Your Highness,

37:57.400 --> 37:59.960
my youngest son is in the temple now.

38:01.440 --> 38:03.320
He is my only son left.

38:04.160 --> 38:05.200
Your Highness,

38:05.760 --> 38:07.680
please be lenient.

38:07.760 --> 38:09.840
Your Highness, please be lenient.

38:12.960 --> 38:13.840
Father.

38:13.920 --> 38:15.520
Do you feel bad for your son?

38:15.600 --> 38:16.720
Why didn't you think about

38:16.800 --> 38:18.440
my child who was yet to be born?

38:19.320 --> 38:20.920
You scoundrels,

38:21.480 --> 38:22.760
I will kill you today!

38:22.840 --> 38:24.480
- Move!
- Your Highness.

38:24.560 --> 38:26.000
Your Highness!

38:26.480 --> 38:28.600
Even if we have to go
to Prince Cheng today,

38:28.680 --> 38:31.840
I won't stand by
and watch you kill my son!

38:31.920 --> 38:32.760
Guards!

38:34.000 --> 38:36.600
- Freeze.
- Li Zhongnan, you dare to go against me?

38:37.400 --> 38:38.240
Stop!

38:41.000 --> 38:42.040
Why are you here?

38:42.120 --> 38:43.640
- Shen Yurong?
- Shen Yurong?

38:43.720 --> 38:45.640
How dare you come to Li Residence?

38:46.440 --> 38:47.920
You are too arrogant.

38:48.480 --> 38:49.720
All of us fell for her trap.

38:50.280 --> 38:51.680
Trap?

38:51.760 --> 38:52.760
What trap?

38:52.840 --> 38:55.920
Please ask them to withdraw.

38:58.240 --> 38:59.440
Stand down!

39:02.120 --> 39:03.000
Get out!

39:07.480 --> 39:08.880
This is a herb from Great Zhao.

39:09.360 --> 39:11.000
No one is using it in Great Yan now.

39:11.760 --> 39:14.680
I asked a physician to find it
and he had a hard time before he did.

39:15.240 --> 39:16.840
The physician said ingesting this herb

39:17.400 --> 39:20.120
will cause someone to have
false pregnancy symptoms within a month.

39:22.880 --> 39:24.280
If Your Highness doesn't believe it,

39:24.840 --> 39:26.120
you can find someone to test it.

39:26.200 --> 39:27.120
No way.

39:28.320 --> 39:29.680
I had people test all my food.

39:30.160 --> 39:31.280
It is impossible.

39:32.400 --> 39:34.160
What about the day
of Consort Li's birthday?

39:34.680 --> 39:36.240
Come on, let's drink.

39:36.800 --> 39:39.880
Eldest Princess Wanning
rarely visits the palace.

39:39.960 --> 39:42.760
This Nv'erhong wine
is specially prepared for you.

39:52.480 --> 39:54.080
This herb only exists in Great Zhao.

39:54.160 --> 39:55.360
I'm sure you still remember

39:55.960 --> 39:58.000
that not only does
Great Zhao's princess Situ Jiuyue

39:58.080 --> 39:59.600
excel in medicine,

39:59.680 --> 40:02.080
she is also on friendly terms
with Xiao Heng and Xue Fangfei.

40:06.680 --> 40:08.000
Nice, Consort Li,

40:08.760 --> 40:10.160
Situ Jiuyue.

40:11.320 --> 40:12.240
How dare

40:13.760 --> 40:15.640
they help Xue Fangfei plot against me?

40:16.720 --> 40:18.680
I can't believe she fooled all of us.

40:20.040 --> 40:21.320
Your Highness.

40:23.000 --> 40:25.200
Please forgive me for being rude just now.

40:26.040 --> 40:26.920
Get lost.

40:28.440 --> 40:29.640
Both of you, get lost!

40:30.280 --> 40:31.120
Yes.

40:33.480 --> 40:34.440
Let's go.

40:36.200 --> 40:37.040
Meixiang.

40:39.280 --> 40:40.120
Yes.

40:40.200 --> 40:41.400
Send a message to Prince Cheng.

40:43.120 --> 40:44.520
Tell him to get the troops ready.

40:45.760 --> 40:46.680
Yes.

40:52.760 --> 40:53.720
Regardless,

40:54.920 --> 40:56.440
your health has been harmed.

40:56.920 --> 40:57.840
Don't be angry.

40:58.520 --> 41:01.080
If you need anything,
just let me do it for you.

41:07.240 --> 41:08.240
This child

41:10.320 --> 41:11.960
was a gift from the heavens.

41:14.480 --> 41:15.480
My child is gone.

41:19.520 --> 41:20.360
She's gone.

41:27.760 --> 41:29.120
Our child is gone.

41:32.000 --> 41:32.880
It's all right.

41:34.200 --> 41:35.760
As long as we are still together,

41:36.880 --> 41:37.960
you will get pregnant again.

41:50.640 --> 41:52.280
I won't have a child anymore.

41:59.840 --> 42:02.320
- Kneel!
- Kill him!

42:02.400 --> 42:04.400
- Kill him!
- Don't move!

42:04.480 --> 42:05.760
- Kneel!
- Don't move!

42:05.840 --> 42:09.320
- Kill him!
- Kill him!

42:09.400 --> 42:15.920
- Kill them!
- Kill them!

42:18.760 --> 42:21.800
He is Dai's general,
whom we've captured alive.

42:22.400 --> 42:23.960
We will retaliate

42:25.280 --> 42:27.680
against those who dare attack
the Great Yan!

42:27.760 --> 42:31.360
- Nice!
- Great!

42:31.440 --> 42:35.760
- Good!
- Yes!

42:35.840 --> 42:38.920
These were the assets
they robbed from all of you.

42:39.760 --> 42:41.680
I got all of them back for you.

42:42.760 --> 42:44.480
If they dare attack again,

42:45.520 --> 42:48.720
I will kill all of them.

42:48.800 --> 42:54.920
- Prince Cheng!
- Prince Cheng!

42:56.480 --> 42:59.280
Your Highness gave all the assets
we seized from Dai to the people.

42:59.760 --> 43:01.280
The military provisions aren't here yet.

43:01.360 --> 43:04.800
Since the gold mine was sealed,
there was no news from Chancellor Li.

43:05.360 --> 43:06.200
The military rations

43:07.400 --> 43:08.320
will run out soon.

43:09.480 --> 43:10.440
What are you afraid of?

43:17.880 --> 43:19.040
The Eldest Princess

43:19.120 --> 43:21.680
made Xiao Heng hand over the fish talisman
to command the Longwu Army?

43:24.840 --> 43:26.160
The Longwu Army.

43:29.000 --> 43:30.680
Good job, Wanning.

43:30.760 --> 43:33.760
If Xiao Minghan
didn't lead the Longwu Army back then,

43:34.760 --> 43:39.160
I wouldn't be suffering
in the north for so long.

44:05.680 --> 44:07.200
You shouldn't have come here.

44:07.280 --> 44:08.200
Master.

44:09.840 --> 44:12.080
Do you want me to accept
Father handing over the throne

44:12.160 --> 44:13.720
to Zhao Ye?

44:13.800 --> 44:15.880
I've fought for Father
in battles for many years

44:15.960 --> 44:17.160
and got injuries all over.

44:17.240 --> 44:18.720
He is just a child

44:18.800 --> 44:20.640
and he'll sit on the throne so easily?

44:20.720 --> 44:22.480
If you assassinate Zhao Ye now,

44:22.560 --> 44:24.760
we will bear the crime
of killing the Emperor.

44:24.840 --> 44:27.360
Then the Imperial Court will be a mess
if you can't suppress them.

44:27.840 --> 44:29.680
It might even bring harm to the people.

44:29.760 --> 44:31.560
Who will you choose
between Zhao Ye and me?

44:31.640 --> 44:33.400
The Longwu Army is outside.

44:33.880 --> 44:35.040
You can't win.

44:35.120 --> 44:37.520
If you give up now, I'll let you go.

44:51.600 --> 44:54.440
This day has finally come.

44:55.760 --> 44:57.280
Without the Longwu Army,

44:57.360 --> 44:59.800
I'll see how the Xiao family stops me.

44:59.880 --> 45:02.520
But for the capital's ancestral worship,
Your Highness can't lead an army

45:02.600 --> 45:04.560
or station the army outside the capital.

45:04.640 --> 45:08.720
Someone has already
come up with a plan for us.

45:16.400 --> 45:17.680
Congratulations, Your Highness.

45:17.760 --> 45:19.080
Your ambition will soon be achieved.

45:21.760 --> 45:22.760
Comrades,

45:24.640 --> 45:27.400
we've been guarding the border
in this poor and cold land for years.

45:27.480 --> 45:30.360
Thousands of soldiers perished in battles,

45:31.000 --> 45:32.600
but what has the Imperial Court given us?

45:32.680 --> 45:34.960
Land? Money and jewelry?

45:35.040 --> 45:37.600
I requested many times,
but we only received a little reward.

45:37.680 --> 45:38.520
However,

45:39.400 --> 45:41.200
I, Zhao Sheng, promise all of you

45:41.280 --> 45:44.360
to one day reward you

45:44.440 --> 45:47.280
with high ranks, generous salaries,
and a luxurious lifestyle.

45:48.360 --> 45:50.120
My destiny has come today.

45:50.600 --> 45:52.240
My ancestral worship in the capital

45:52.960 --> 45:54.680
will be the best time

45:54.760 --> 45:56.080
to change the ruler

45:56.160 --> 45:58.400
by advancing south
for a surprise attack on the capital.

46:00.240 --> 46:01.360
Generals, obey my command!

46:04.360 --> 46:05.320
- Yes!
- Yes!

46:05.880 --> 46:06.920
Get the troops ready.

46:07.880 --> 46:09.760
Once I claim the capital,

46:09.840 --> 46:12.120
send troops immediately to back me up.

46:14.040 --> 46:16.160
- We'll stand with you, Prince Cheng!
- We'll stand with you, Prince Cheng!

46:25.960 --> 46:26.800
My lord,

46:26.880 --> 46:28.520
after Shen Yurong went to Li Residence,

46:28.600 --> 46:29.680
it has been quiet there.

46:29.760 --> 46:31.840
Later on, Eldest Princess' Mansion
sent a letter to the north.

46:32.520 --> 46:35.400
I think Ms. Jiang Li's plan is exposed.

46:37.360 --> 46:38.720
In that case,

46:39.320 --> 46:41.600
we need to be ready to fight them head-on.

46:41.680 --> 46:43.360
Yes. I will prepare for it now.

46:56.360 --> 46:57.920
See if you dare
to randomly take medicines again.

46:58.000 --> 47:00.200
Jiuyue told me there are no side effects.

47:00.760 --> 47:02.080
How can you believe what she says?

47:04.880 --> 47:06.000
It's just a pity

47:06.960 --> 47:08.640
that they didn't turn against each other.

47:08.720 --> 47:10.240
I didn't get to help you though.

47:10.840 --> 47:12.760
Avoiding bloodshed is just hope.

47:13.520 --> 47:16.480
Sometimes, a fight is still necessary.

47:23.320 --> 47:24.440
Will you get hurt?

47:24.520 --> 47:25.760
You should ask me

47:26.480 --> 47:27.560
if I will die or not.

47:33.560 --> 47:34.760
Don't worry.

47:34.840 --> 47:35.760
This time,

47:36.880 --> 47:38.320
I will be your pawn.

47:39.400 --> 47:40.640
Sit in a high position

47:41.240 --> 47:42.960
and watch me help you win this battle.

47:43.040 --> 47:44.200
No matter what,

47:45.600 --> 47:46.440
don't die.

47:50.680 --> 47:51.760
There will be a storm.

47:52.880 --> 47:54.800
Don't leave Jiang Residence
for no good reason.

47:54.880 --> 47:56.560
Find Zhao Ke if you need anything.

47:56.640 --> 47:59.000
I will take care
of your father and your brother.

48:00.200 --> 48:01.200
What about you?

48:01.760 --> 48:02.880
As long as you are fine,

48:04.880 --> 48:05.840
I'll be fine as well.
